AVD-KSV-0045 exp:2027-08-31
AVD-KSV-0048 exp:2027-08-31
AVD-KSV-0049 exp:2027-08-31
AVD-KSV-0056 exp:2027-08-31
AVD-KSV-0113 exp:2027-08-31
AVD-KSV-0114 exp:2027-08-31

# node-exporter is a host metrics collector - hostNetwork/hostPID/hostPath(/,/proc,/sys) and
# the resulting missing seccomp profile are the mechanism, not a bug.
AVD-KSV-0009 exp:2027-08-31
